   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d8519521-4d16-42e7-b427-047dcc82d0e2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "# **Accident Severity Prediction (Road Safety AI Project)**\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Project Description**\n",
    "\n",
    "This project aims to develop an artificial intelligence model capable of predicting the **severity of road accidents** based on the circumstances surrounding each accident. The goal is to support road safety analysis, prioritize prevention actions, and improve emergency response strategies.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Objective**\n",
    "\n",
    "Build a high-performing **multi-class classification model** to estimate accident severity from available data, maximizing predictive performance while ensuring interpretability and reliability.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Data Type**\n",
    "\n",
    "The project uses **tabular accident data**, combining multiple tables from the dataset, including:\n",
    "\n",
    "* Accident location and road type\n",
    "* Time and date of the accident\n",
    "* Environmental conditions (weather, lighting, etc.)\n",
    "* Accident context and circumstances\n",
    "* Victim severity label derived from user data\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Business Context**\n",
    "\n",
    "Road accidents represent a major public safety issue with significant human, social, and economic costs.\n",
    "Manual analysis of accident data is complex and time-consuming.\n",
    "Automation via AI enables:\n",
    "\n",
    "* Better understanding of risk factors\n",
    "* Prioritization of prevention measures\n",
    "* Faster decision-making for road safety policies\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Final Objective**\n",
    "\n",
    "* **Problem Addressed:**\n",
    "  Multi-class classification of accident severity (4 categories)\n",
    "\n",
    "* **Evaluation:**\n",
    "  Use metrics suitable for imbalanced classes, such as **precision, recall, F1-score**, and **macro-averaged AUC-ROC**\n",
    "\n",
    "* **Deliverable:**\n",
    "  A predictive model ready to be integrated into a road safety analytics pipeline or deployed via an API for real-world use\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "59ee6600-2768-4323-a831-ed050a5c6dd4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
