   "source": [
    "In the summary statistics for the maximum authorized speeds, there are clearly inconsistent values. It appears that some entries contain an extra zero, which results in unrealistic speed limits. This suggests that the data contains errors and requires cleaning or correction before any analysis.\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
