   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fbf5f483-5fc2-4443-b27d-7ab61ad1dc9d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### **Type Conversion and Normalization**\n",
    "\n",
    "**Conversions performed:**\n",
    "\n",
    "* lat/long: commas → dots (European → standard format), then converted to numeric\n",
    "* nbv, vma, larrout, actp: converted using `to_numeric` with `errors='coerce'`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Result:** consistent dtypes for imputation and modeling\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 30,
   "id": "7cc86138-6433-4eea-a2e8-a43a8084294d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "for col in [\"lat\", \"long\"]:\n",
    "    caract_all[col] = (\n",
    "        caract_all[col]\n",
    "        .astype(str)\n",
    "        .str.replace(\",\", \".\", regex=False)\n",
    "        .str.strip()\n",
    "    )"
   ]
  },
