  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 33,
   "id": "533c4eae-5344-41c5-b2af-5efa5c145e0c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "caract_clean = caract_all.drop(columns = [\"hrmn\", \"adr\"])\n",
    "usagers_clean = usagers_all.drop(columns = \"num_veh\")\n",
    "lieux_clean = lieux_all.drop(columns = [\"voie\", \"v1\",\"pr\",\"pr1\"])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ec065bcd-514f-4d67-889a-ed892ba36c1d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3.**Feature Engineering**\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Aggregation at the Accident Level (Num_Acc)**\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objective:** shift from the “user” granularity to the “accident” granularity (multiple users per accident).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Aggregation strategies:**\n",
    "\n",
    "* **Categorical features** (e.g., location): mode (most frequent value)\n",
    "* **Numerical features** (e.g., location): max/mean (to capture intensity)\n",
    "* **User targets:** `grav_accident = max(grav_num)`, `nb_usagers = count`, `nb_vehicules = count`, etc.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Result:** 1 row = 1 accident with aggregated features\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 34,
   "id": "5eb01096-a9f1-4fb1-aed3-86d9c561b826",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "lieux_clean[[ \"larrout\", \"nbv\"]] = lieux_clean[[ \"larrout\", \"nbv\"]].apply(\n",
    "    lambda x: pd.to_numeric(x, errors=\"coerce\")\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "usagers_clean[[\"actp\"]] = usagers_clean[[\"actp\"]].apply(\n",
    "    lambda x: pd.to_numeric(x, errors=\"coerce\"))\n",
    "\n",
    "caract_clean[[\"lat\", \"long\"]] = caract_clean[[\"lat\", \"long\"]].apply(\n",
    "    pd.to_numeric, errors=\"coerce\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "lieux_clean[\"vma\"] = lieux_clean[\"vma\"].apply(lambda x: x // 10 if x > 130 else x)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "cols_mean_lieux = [\"nbv\", \"vma\", \"larrout\"]\n",
    "cols_mean_usagers =[ \"an_nais\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "cols_mode_lieux = [ \"circ\",\"vma\", \"vosp\", \"infra\", \"nbv\", \"prof\", \"surf\", \"situ\", \"plan\", ]\n",
    "cols_mode_usagers = [\"trajet\", \"locp\", \"secu2\", \"secu1\", \"sexe\", \"place\", \"actp\"]\n",
    "cols_mode_caract = [\"col\", \"atm\", \"int\", \"lum\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "lieux_clean[cols_mean_lieux] = lieux_clean[cols_mean_lieux].fillna(lieux_clean[cols_mean_lieux].mean())\n",
    "usagers_clean[cols_mean_usagers] = usagers_clean[cols_mean_usagers].fillna(usagers_clean[cols_mean_usagers].mean())\n",
    "\n",
    "for col in cols_mode_lieux:\n",
    "    lieux_clean[col] = lieux_clean[col].fillna(lieux_clean[col].mode()[0])\n",
    "\n",
    "for col in cols_mode_usagers:\n",
    "    usagers_clean[col] = usagers_clean[col].fillna(usagers_clean[col].mode()[0])\n",
    "\n",
    "for col in cols_mode_caract:\n",
    "    caract_clean[col] = caract_clean[col].fillna(caract_clean[col].mode()[0])\n"
   ]
  },
