  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c8a643da-0e9a-4b2e-b0e5-7e1d2897a370",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Construction of relevant indicators:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **grav_num**: encode severity (1→0, 4→1, 3→2, 2→3) to make it ordinal\n",
    "2. **age**: calculated from `an_nais`\n",
    "3. **age_cat**: binning into 5 categories [0–2], [3–11], [12–17], [18–64], [65+]\n",
    "4. **protege**: binary indicator (seatbelt/helmet worn)\n",
    "5. **Roles**: `is_conducteur`, `is_passager`, `is_pieton`, `is_femme`, `is_homme`\n",
    "6. **locp**: grouping into 3 categories (from 4 → 3 categories)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 54,
   "id": "289de54c-95c2-489c-b592-62bf6a412d6c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 1) Gravité (usager → accident)\n",
    "grav_map = {1: 0, 4: 1, 3: 2, 2: 3}\n",
    "usagers_clean[\"grav_num\"] = usagers_clean[\"grav\"].map(grav_map)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 2) Age\n",
    "usagers_clean[\"age\"] = 2026 - usagers_all[\"an_nais\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "bins = [0, 2, 11, 17, 64, 120]\n",
    "labels = ['0-2', '3-11', '12-17', '18-64', '65+']\n",
    "\n",
    "usagers_clean['age_cat'] = pd.cut(\n",
    "    usagers_clean['age'],\n",
    "    bins=bins,\n",
    "    labels=labels,\n",
    "    include_lowest=True\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# 3) Protections\n",
    "usagers_clean[\"protege\"] = (\n",
    "    (usagers_clean[[\"secu1\", \"secu2\"]] > 0)\n",
    "    .any(axis=1)\n",
    "    .astype(int)\n",
    ")\n"
   ]
  },
